R70 1 0 20.6T  
R71 2 0 20.6T 
R72 1 2 20T 
I80 1 2 0.5p
*
* Noise, PSRR, and CMRR
I20 21 20 423U
D20 20  0 DN1
D21  0 21 DN1
G26  0 26 POLY(1) 3 4   110U -49U
R26 26  0 1
G27  0 27 POLY(2) 1 0 2 0   -440U 39.7U 39.7U
R27 27  0 1
*
* Open Loop Gain, Slew Rate
G30  0 30 POLY(1) 12 11   0 1
R30 30  0 1K
G31  0 31 POLY(1) 3 4 86 5.25
R31 31  0 1 TC=2.8m
